words.txt, words.bin and sensitive.txt are derived from the Grammalecte/Dicollecte French Hunspell dictionary v7.7, "Classique" variant (Olivier R. and contributors, https://grammalecte.net/), used under MPL 2.0, and modified: expanded to all word forms, normalized to uppercase without accents, cedilla or diaeresis, with Œ and Æ written as OE and AE, filtered to 3-12 letters and with a list of offensive words removed. words.bin is the same list in the SWD1 binary format. Source form: https://github.com/jeroba/swipe-word-dictionaries
